  "analysis": "The review describes strategy gameplay involving building and expanding an empire, plus real-time battles against other players. Building and expansion are ordinary progression mechanics and do not match a dark-pattern label. The explicit player-versus-player combat supports Competition. No monetization, scheduling, reward, collection, social-pressure, or technical mechanic is described.",
